            <div xml:id="d76">

                <pb facs="0171" n="73" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg73"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">760c.60f/86: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commissioner at Vienna</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Frazier</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-03-11T13:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 11,
                                1921—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 3:53 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>“Department’s telegram March 3, 5 p.m., via Paris, reached me at Teschen March
                    8th. Announced my withdrawal to Boundary Commission March 9th, have returned to
                    Vienna to resume my regular work. Repeat to Secretary of State. DuBois.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Frazier</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
